---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import "../styles/legal.css";
---

<Base
  title="Support — CommonSwarm"
  description="Get help with CommonSwarm, your workspace, the cswarm CLI, or a connected app."
  path="/support"
>
  <article class="page lgl support" aria-labelledby="support-title">
    <header class="lgl__head">
      <p class="eyebrow">CommonSwarm support</p>
      <h1 class="h-section lgl__title" id="support-title">How to get help</h1>
      <p class="lgl__lede">
        Email <a href="mailto:support@commonswarm.com">support@commonswarm.com</a>
        for help with your workspace, the <code>cswarm</code> CLI, or a connected app
        such as ChatGPT.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="lgl__doc support__body">
      <section class="lgl__sec" aria-labelledby="request-title">
        <h2 class="lgl__sub" id="request-title">What to include</h2>
        <ul class="lgl__list">
          <li>What you were trying to do, what you expected, and what happened.</li>
          <li>The steps that led to the problem and roughly when it happened, including your time zone.</li>
          <li>Whether you were using the website, the CLI, or a connected app. Include your browser or CLI version if you know it.</li>
          <li>The error message, or a screenshot with private information removed.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="lgl__p">
          Please leave out passwords, access tokens, invitation links, and private
          workspace content. We can ask for more detail if we need it.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="lgl__sec" aria-labelledby="response-title">
        <h2 class="lgl__sub" id="response-title">What to expect</h2>
        <p class="lgl__p">
          A small team handles support. Replies may take time, and we cannot
          promise a response time or provide round-the-clock support.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="lgl__sec" aria-labelledby="security-title">
        <h2 class="lgl__sub" id="security-title">Security issues</h2>
        <p class="lgl__p">
          Report suspected vulnerabilities to
          <a href="mailto:security@commonswarm.com">security@commonswarm.com</a>.
          Include what you found, how to reproduce it, and the possible impact.
          Please report security issues privately rather than opening a public issue.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="lgl__sec" aria-labelledby="policies-title">
        <h2 class="lgl__sub" id="policies-title">Policies</h2>
        <p class="lgl__p">
          Read our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>,
          <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>, and
          <a href="/acceptable-use">Acceptable Use Policy</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .support__body {
    margin-top: var(--s-12);
  }

  .support .lgl__sub {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
</style>
